{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>銅鑼灣Cafe推介｜香港Cafe｜銅鑼灣聚集各式各樣的品牌，近日變成大家逛街的好去處。如果逛街逛街到累，大家都要找地方休息。今次《香港01》「好食玩飛」記者推介10大銅鑼灣咖啡店，體驗不同風格的咖啡店，有坐擁180度維港海景Cafe、貴婦級Vivienne Westwood、必食流心巴斯克。即看下文啦！</p><p>👉follow好食玩飛ig✈️免費睇旅遊飲食攻略</p><p>銅鑼灣cafe推介【1】TheBerlin Service——工業風韓系咖啡店／必食蜆肉意粉</p><p>銅鑼灣新開的韓系咖啡店，裝修採用工業風，Cafe佔地兩層，空間感十足，適合打卡拍照。店內主要提供意粉、三文治、小食、甜品和特色咖啡。店裏的招牌必試白酒蜆肉意粉，蜆肉大隻又新鮮，味道超鮮甜，清湯底更帶有淡淡的白酒香。甜品方面，Tiramisu入口軟滑，咖啡與酒香的味道平衡得恰到好處，甜而不膩。</p><figure><img alt=\"The Berlin Service（紙箱上的貓＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168606139470843904201379.jpeg/3UwFu3oWzi675CUP3Bk88W1wMm-txMY9fLUaany1Gmo\"/><figcaption>The Berlin Service（紙箱上的貓＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"The Berlin Service（紙箱上的貓＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168606141823979520513904.jpeg/Fp2jUOZEUOtekblqjil0K9YTnPecisJSiFOsc4hTrHM\"/><figcaption>The Berlin Service（紙箱上的貓＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"The Berlin Service（紙箱上的貓＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168606144097423360758140.jpeg/JStKWM8WX7z0Z12XsQ0XsrBoKu2BP_rrVq_PL1avzy8\"/><figcaption>The Berlin Service（紙箱上的貓＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"The Berlin Service（紙箱上的貓＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168606146651885568372054.jpeg/-al_zSe5WeDk79IgXMYK-3NCuAjwxv4Zn4uoSZ-LqEk\"/><figcaption>The Berlin Service（紙箱上的貓＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><p>地址：銅鑼灣渣甸街51號地下</p><p>人均：$100-$200</p><p>銅鑼灣cafe推介【2】Elephant Grounds（Fashion Walk店）——必食雪糕三文治</p><p>Elephant Grounds在銅鑼灣一向人氣極高，店鋪偏向歐美風格，設有戶外座位，環境開揚且寵物友善，氛圍十分寫意。店內食物以健康為主，提供Poke Bowl、沙律等，被譽為減脂的好去處。這裡的招牌甜品是雪糕三文治，最多人推介花生醬口味，味道濃郁，雪糕口感順滑。</p><figure><img alt=\"Elephant Grounds（小周飽飽＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168606895376699392826139.jpeg/IVg0aAFc4GQylAjtzJOn8g17Bx4_M5f3M-aO_zPmjv8\"/><figcaption>Elephant Grounds（小周飽飽＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Elephant Grounds（小周飽飽＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168606897780166656908635.jpeg/KV63Zna2sgNEL8VQrCxVm9vMEJJVGbREn1ByTp9Qck4\"/><figcaption>Elephant Grounds（小周飽飽＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Elephant Grounds（小周飽飽＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168606900208799744160237.jpeg/jWdJk6FBkg5sLIxtlhYevF8rrU472YKXElCMPBJQjDw\"/><figcaption>Elephant Grounds（小周飽飽＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Elephant Grounds（小周飽飽＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168606902641627136398720.jpeg/2H6p84BmZ-H9xfBD0xdGYLsIxKUR3WAnE6CvKhOgryo\"/><figcaption>Elephant Grounds（小周飽飽＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><p>地址：銅鑼灣百德新街42-48號FashionWalk地下C舖</p><p>人均：$150-$250</p><p>銅鑼灣cafe推介【3】Vivienne Westwood Café——貴婦級英式下午茶</p><p>由時裝品牌Vivienne Westwood打造的Cafe，將品牌經典的格紋與華麗元素融入餐飲體驗中。店鋪裝修分為傳統英式茶室和現代走廊兩個區域，餐具及甜品上隨處可見經典的土星Logo，高級感滿滿。這裡的三層架下午茶食物精緻，絕對是打卡必去之選。</p><figure><img alt=\"來喝粥＠小紅書\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168608049774989312582349.jpeg/nPhOnNy0vUbE61PBS9zteSNq_wM7xV92CwftCAsH7Qg\"/><figcaption>來喝粥＠小紅書</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"來喝粥＠小紅書\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168608052149096448538071.jpeg/d_7HE2xaCrskM609E_IYp0sPcbYM4KiCsV8M0LFfDNA\"/><figcaption>來喝粥＠小紅書</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"天天開心＠小紅書\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168608054728724480560738.jpeg/Wjvjhc_NgWtLl3UAOVVvOuQXgDLqoNXAmV1Op5ldTqc\"/><figcaption>天天開心＠小紅書</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"天天開心＠小紅書\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168608057631313920370658.jpeg/wxf7gRCkCg-VcitxKCd8ypGF6ZJil3neW5Rp8FuUafA\"/><figcaption>天天開心＠小紅書</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"天天開心＠小紅書\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168608060177387520698752.jpeg/VQQIrhDqAPMnpmsiEfWSW7DiqX-Z5saTOvaHMzr2hzM\"/><figcaption>天天開心＠小紅書</figcaption></figure><p>地址：香港銅鑼灣百德新街27-47號9-10號地舖</p><p>人均：$300-$500</p><p>銅鑼灣cafe推介【4】18 Grams——亞洲50大最佳咖啡廳</p><p>18 Grams曾榮獲亞洲50大最佳咖啡廳，吸引不少人前來朝聖。店內的咖啡由世界級咖啡師主理，咖啡豆也是本地新鮮烘焙。除了招牌的濃縮咖啡、泡沫咖啡和冷萃咖啡外，店家還巧妙地運用咖啡元素創作不同特飲，如氣泡薄荷美式咖啡、香橙朱古力咖啡、菠蘿咖啡湯力等。</p><figure><img alt=\"白冰桃美＠小紅書\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168608540105904128478160.jpeg/u6Iie3WBnc7OXr9mQOS_9GAb0qt2S3klWSACMVkgAjE\"/><figcaption>白冰桃美＠小紅書</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白冰桃美＠小紅書\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168608542429679616341908.jpeg/SPYwrIMfF1LVZv2pSyDIg-lMgI1FjLfJhAateYQGrXk\"/><figcaption>白冰桃美＠小紅書</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白冰桃美＠小紅書\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168608544619237376594283.jpeg/s_wYPpVoZSFCZXTAygtlANCMOX6IyMZf-WzbfPls23w\"/><figcaption>白冰桃美＠小紅書</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白冰桃美＠小紅書\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168608547001733120654173.jpeg/3iFHp-cQOSks-n-Z_CXg6ABw8kCkxEg-xdcJbcXXCW0\"/><figcaption>白冰桃美＠小紅書</figcaption></figure><p>地址：銅鑼灣景隆街15號海都大廈地下C號舖</p><p>人均：$51-$100</p><p>銅鑼灣cafe推介【5】UMI——180度維港海景／必食帶子明太子意粉</p><p>UMI環境舒適，更坐擁180度維港海景，無論日景還是夜景都能盡收眼底。食物方面性價比相當高，店內招牌包括火炙北海道帶子明太子意大利粉，香煎的帶子外香內嫩，意大利粉裹滿明太子及蟹籽，非常有口感。飲品方面，提拉米蘇咖啡和芒芒甘露都超受歡迎，可以邊飲邊享受甜品。</p><figure><img alt=\"（hkfo.odlover＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168609285354033152918236.jpeg/xTwbgROxndVR3qTFEeVK4ASpXtsUqjibGQcH0RkHB9E\"/><figcaption>（hkfo.odlover＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（吃喝玩樂夫妻＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168609443311521792594023.jpeg/C2mheKdLQuTPJO2GB2ZmJrv9itOqjuW1eoN0FHqDdBQ\"/><figcaption>（吃喝玩樂夫妻＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（吃喝玩樂夫妻＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168609445756932096781596.jpeg/kx6-BLDTiSac4gGuYCE5YjGsCi5Dz8ZrODECFDgxAhQ\"/><figcaption>（吃喝玩樂夫妻＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（吃喝玩樂夫妻＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168609448177176576176305.jpeg/qf11DWGT5d5ptwva5GeFlOx4yqEe9s7HPu09cT7tPXE\"/><figcaption>（吃喝玩樂夫妻＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（hkfo.odlover＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168609287736528896248710.jpeg/U0hoYxjzAMUiLJE0nUbgBUPBLB6id2ZGblFo6W5RaOk\"/><figcaption>（hkfo.odlover＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（hkfo.odlover＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168609290223882240968513.jpeg/qymJjb5HHqi9lWLB96FYzCdREdVt7rRSUuKCXFLiglw\"/><figcaption>（hkfo.odlover＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><p>地址：銅鑼灣告士打道229-230號宇宙商業大廈18樓</p><p>人均：$101-$200</p><p>銅鑼灣cafe推介【6】EN Coffee2.0——必食流心Cheesecake</p><p>位於銅鑼灣禮頓中心的EN coffee，空間比中環本店更大。新店新增了三文治、Cheesecake Tiramisu等輕食，而Basque Cheesecake絕對是店舖的亮點——質地鬆軟細滑，中心帶有微微流心效果，芝士味濃郁卻不會過甜，入口輕盈順口，幾乎沒有膩感，搭配咖啡簡直是絕配。</p><figure><img alt=\"（是啊欣ya@小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168610617557258240248075.jpeg/0ef8KyCtSWuXR_nMxa44Aik57zYUE17rbxsAs28bALM\"/><figcaption>（是啊欣ya@小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（是啊欣ya@小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168610620040417280863041.jpeg/USxHjEuj0JezTlwawHSwkpWm7OaGHkwUSgLu_0oC7v8\"/><figcaption>（是啊欣ya@小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（是啊欣ya@小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168610622741680128046519.jpeg/jP3-bOwsIoJjglaiCERW2tjJ6kpuV8zdDFHERgxRxEY\"/><figcaption>（是啊欣ya@小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（是啊欣ya@小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168610625245810688145796.jpeg/cvynrfXL4SODoK1UeyX2kQQL15D0en1g0kL92NJC_dg\"/><figcaption>（是啊欣ya@小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（是啊欣ya@小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168610627439562752820453.jpeg/lMzxj2R23aZ-1sQxr9zDQT-jTWgoPxQ5yMcClcjHApU\"/><figcaption>（是啊欣ya@小紅書）</figcaption></figure><p>地址：銅鑼灣禮頓道77號禮頓中心地下G06號舖</p><p>人均：$51-$100</p><p>銅鑼灣cafe推介【7】The Coffeeology——必食Tiramisu</p><figure><img alt=\"圖片授權：Instagram@hungry.tummies\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220524/605841899202285568405928.jpeg/gzHIvjW3TURhyhg8av2mz2SjfVlqt1R7b2Sqd29kqnc\"/><figcaption>圖片授權：Instagram@hungry.tummies</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"圖片授權：Instagram@breadaholic_\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220524/605841901396037632415286.jpeg/sq_bwOWiNpj_uJsqHPYMMVBkZ9pWUhQEGshJFxrISRc\"/><figcaption>圖片授權：Instagram@breadaholic_</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"圖片授權：Instagram@breadaholic_\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220524/605841903753367552458173.jpeg/lW8syRUdB8ba1m-DPFqHKkXUwn-q611C6bn_P-m5_z8\"/><figcaption>圖片授權：Instagram@breadaholic_</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"圖片授權：Instagram@nicgau_ss\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220525/606105268580913152407523.jpeg/AKqrL4c1gq1aaNYAI_ycpiZcqKmaVmK1_b__-f2___k\"/><figcaption>圖片授權：Instagram@nicgau_ss</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"圖片授權：Instagram@nicgau_ss\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220525/606105265841901568017543.jpeg/mDhSpJIftWZcsGHxWLs0LK2u89YDQqiJGFGrXRhRq10\"/><figcaption>圖片授權：Instagram@nicgau_ss</figcaption></figure><p>銅鑼灣工業風Cafe「The Coffeeology」主打多款甜品，如招牌Tiramisu、抹茶芝士蛋糕、焙茶芝士蛋糕等。招牌原味Tiramisu同樣熱賣，加入日本蛋及傳統Marsala酒，讓味道更有層次；並使用House Blend咖啡浸泡手指餅，呈現經典意式風味。</p><p>地址：銅鑼灣勿地臣街15A號地舖</p><p>人均：$51-$100</p><p>銅鑼灣cafe推介【8】NOC Coffee Co.——工作必去Cafe</p><p>NOC是著名的咖啡連鎖店，銅鑼灣店裝修以白色和水泥灰為主調，空間感十足，非常適合工作或閱讀。NOC選用自家烘焙的精品咖啡豆，除了咖啡外，也提供多款健康輕食，如牛油果吐司、巴西莓果碗等，以及每日新鮮出爐的烘焙點心。點一杯咖啡就能坐上一整個下午，非常適合在咖啡廳辦公。</p><figure><img alt=\"（Pp吖＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168611668842778624938267.jpeg/kvaJb9XKsJkh1D9uQlHIR2fj15AKvSdqJAudByQLnQc\"/><figcaption>（Pp吖＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Pp吖＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168611671296577536601974.jpeg/GtuwGSxUq8mOgruAY1G_ZPZ-ohtzJaxMW51TfludU34\"/><figcaption>（Pp吖＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Pp吖＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168611673683267584082745.jpeg/PIbCUndKhpngV5NyuubPnExCDy8DUnK2YxZ3KGMWdyg\"/><figcaption>（Pp吖＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Pp吖＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168611675956711424964720.jpeg/8TJ6N8bosMtKSV2HcUHTS2sELpT5pc69IJox0CCaMdA\"/><figcaption>（Pp吖＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><p>地址：香港島銅鑼灣開平道10號ShopG23,G/F</p><p>人均：$51-$100</p><p>銅鑼灣cafe推介【9】Artista Perfetto——鬧市中寧靜/泡沫黑咖啡</p><p>如果想在銅鑼灣鬧市中尋找一絲寧靜，不妨到位於霎西街的Artista Perfetto。這裡環境清幽，擺放了幾棵植物點綴；店內座位不多，戶外亦設有一張長椅。咖啡選擇約有10多款，同時售賣Cheesecake、曲奇等甜品。不少人推薦泡沫黑咖啡，相比普通黑咖啡更加濃厚順滑，非常值得一試。</p><figure><img alt=\"（aimeeyans＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168612450971422720985263.jpeg/ZnxZsZYNU_TKo-vi65y8EHKxT0cTMbdfPl56FT5eehU\"/><figcaption>（aimeeyans＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（aimeeyans＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168612453353918464954170.jpeg/hjD2Ef4SgDuOeM0QbV5dytVT4JG_H8bA7hMTZe4TE2U\"/><figcaption>（aimeeyans＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（aimeeyans＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168612455514116096593284.jpeg/pnbf_Q3tYGN0XTrxwPn3oWBE_qC7j5Q61Wpq3NVqatw\"/><figcaption>（aimeeyans＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（aimeeyans＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168612457745616896491382.jpeg/JYFM5O_QG_O8exUJ_c12T8nFEn47bR9y9i1f5vYtX-Y\"/><figcaption>（aimeeyans＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（aimeeyans＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168612460232970240845172.jpeg/0UBnxVzhdlA-xWhjSt2F9oiIyNyjTlklEIUJRRCFCUU\"/><figcaption>（aimeeyans＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><p>地址：銅鑼灣霎西街3A號地下2號舖</p><p>人均：$31-$50</p><p>銅鑼灣cafe推介【10】Ramie——朱古力控必去！必飲Mochaccino</p><p>朱古力控必收藏！Ramie Coffee店面裝修帶有復古風，木質吧檯上擺滿來自不同產區的朱古力磚，牆上掛著50年代的光影廣告海報，全店瀰漫著烘焙朱古力的甜香。必點招牌Mochaccino，將濃縮咖啡與手工調製的朱古力奶混合，頂層鋪著細緻奶泡，杯底還藏著碎朱古力脆粒，口感極具層次。</p><figure><img alt=\"（吸吸梨啊＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168613073565519872708329.jpeg/C6kgWs_pA6W_P8ZqUx6RWjlLHngXOyA8Q_51E0P-dRM\"/><figcaption>（吸吸梨啊＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（吸吸梨啊＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168613076115787776492860.jpeg/SvUt_qRRit6V5DGjCoRDBq5-cSAjaqZE6DbJ2-g2yds\"/><figcaption>（吸吸梨啊＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（吸吸梨啊＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168613078502477824120763.jpeg/fmhd9mlUq8g50_SNky8o_ttjEavN7tT8euPuHXrj7h0\"/><figcaption>（吸吸梨啊＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（吸吸梨啊＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168613080847224832260791.jpeg/Iik_1Dmz5oFNc0iEhrCbpQqQZtjeLH11kZPVUJGT1VA\"/><figcaption>（吸吸梨啊＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（吸吸梨啊＠小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168613083221331968904173.jpeg/8bfBnZKzQqop_5OkOXrZdWfpBuRvziWet5mDHLeZgxw\"/><figcaption>（吸吸梨啊＠小紅書）</figcaption></figure><p>地址：香港島銅鑼灣告士打道272號11號地舖</p><p>人均：$51-$100</p><p>（全文完）👉follow好食玩飛ig✈️免費睇旅遊飲食攻略</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-24T10:23:09.318601+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":3105,"images":47,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}